  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting @#$%': Quiet Mining Colony (posted 'QMC'), Heading For The Medical Frigate, Cloud City: West Gallery, Bespin, Squadron Assignments, Battle Plan, Draw Their Fire; these count toward the 60. Several Effects start, none named as the starting Effect.",
  "Section headers 'Starting @#$%', 'Green' (weapons), 'Blue' (starships) and 'Scrub Card' (above I'll Take The Leader) are not cards.",
  "Posted 'Leia Quarter' dested Cloud City: Guest Quarters (Leia deploys -2 there); 'North Coridor' dested Cloud City: North Corridor.",
  "Posted 'Leia with Stick' dested Leia With Blaster Rifle: the poster calls all the Enhanced Premiere characters 'with Stick'/'with Gun', and Leia has no lightsaber card.",
  "Posted 'Bespin Celebration' (under Effects) dested Cloud City Celebration, the Effect deployed on Bespin; the strategy's 'drain him for 4, retrieve 3' fits it.",
  "Posted 'Han triple Damage Card' dested I've Got A Bad Feeling About This (triples battle damage if Han is present); 'TT & OOC' dested Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; 'Gift of ta mere' dested Gift Of The Mentor (adds battle destiny with Luke and Obi-Wan).",
  "Posted 'Wedge Antilles Squad Daddy' dested Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Pulsar Stake' dested Pulsar Skate; 'Squad Assignement' dested Squadron Assignments."
